Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:12:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] DACAI: compose thumbnails on the UI background

0x70 draws SRAM JPEGs opaque, so the black backing that 0x24 filters away on
DWIN stayed visible as a black square around every print preview. On DACAI,
thumbnails are composed on the UI background (file preview) or on the print
tile artwork with background-coloured corners. The colour is the centre of
its RGB565 step, so JPEG rounding still decodes to the exact UI colour, and
quality 100 keeps the 4:2:0 colour fringe within 2 px of model edges.
